  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;span pt=&quot;&quot; sans=&quot;&quot;&gt;The proposed development, by reason of the addition of a separate front entrance to create a visible new dwellinghouse, would unbalance the proportions of the existing semi-detached dwellings, creating the appearance of a terrace which would be out of keeping with the prevailing pattern of development. The proposed development would be at odds with the established character of the site and wider streetscene from a visual and use perspective. The proposal is therefore found to be contrary to Policy D3 of the London Plan (2021) and Policy GR1 and Policy GR10 of the Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041).&lt;/span&gt;"
  ],
